see LICENSE.

Vendored: Online Python Tutor — Python tracer
---------------------------------------------
  vendor/pg_logger.py
  vendor/pg_encoder.py

From Online Python Tutor (https://github.com/pgbovine/OnlinePythonTutor/),
Copyright (C) Philip J. Guo (philip@pgbovine.net), MIT License.

Local modifications:
  - removed `import imp` and replaced imp.new_module() with types.ModuleType()
    for Python 3.12+ compatibility
  - made two regex literals raw strings to silence SyntaxWarnings

The OPT trace JSON format (consumed by viewer_template.html and produced by the
JavaScript tracer) also originates from Online Python Tutor.

Not vendored: C/C++ and Java backends
-------------------------------------
The C/C++ (Valgrind-based) and Java (java_jail traceprinter) tracers are run as
prebuilt Docker images built on demand from OPT's mirror (see docker/README.md).
Their source is NOT included in this repository.

  - C/C++ backend: MIT (Philip J. Guo)
  - Java java_jail / traceprinter: AGPL-3.0 (David Pritchard). codeviz only
    orchestrates the image; redistributors of the image must preserve AGPL.

The JavaScript/TypeScript tracer (tracers/js/trace.js) is original work for the
modern V8 Inspector Protocol and is NOT derived from OPT's jslogger.js.
